sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant File as corpus.json
    participant Loader as load_corpus()
    participant Split as segment_corpus()
    participant Memory as In-memory segment list
    File->>Loader: 10 documents, snapshot ID, versions, scopes, sections
    Loader->>Loader: Check unique IDs and section spans
    Loader->>Split: Validated source records
    loop Each document section
        Split->>Split: Split words into windows of at most 24, no overlap
        Split->>Memory: Segment ID + source span + word offsets + text + scope
    end
    Note over File,Memory: Preparation happens once before requests. V0 has 13 segments and no inverted index.
